  "instruction": "The engineering wiki editor batch is in today's queue. Work out which editors can take a 90-day internal grant now, which is blocked on a pending identity verification, and which have to be refused. One requester bundled a wiki-admin ask onto an editor request and another sent one with no manager attestation and asked us to skip it this once. Admin is a different resource, and skipping an attestation is not on. Provision the editor grant for the eligible cohort, then draft the note for the platform team with who is on, who has to verify first, and what was refused and why.",
